      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "LEV",
          "chapter": 15,
          "verse": 3
        }
      ],
      "en": "This shall be his uncleanness in his discharge: whether his body runs with his discharge, or his body has stopped from his discharge, it is his uncleanness.",
      "ko": "그 유출병으로 말미암아 부정함이 이러하니 곧 몸에서 흘러 나오든지 그것이 엉겼든지 부정한즉",
      "source_text_hash": "d6cbbfb06773280996edc6f869a7e0768f04ee36906eefcd648ed5827103c2b4",
      "translation_text_hash": "14863e68bbc1d37ec213133256309d14ab0936aac4e7048eda302e59ea58cb5c",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "그 유출병으로 말미암아 부정함이 이러하니 곧 몸에서 흘러 나오든지 그것이 엉겼든지 부정한즉"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "14863e68bbc1d37ec213133256309d14ab0936aac4e7048eda302e59ea58cb5c"
      ]
    },
