        {
          "book": "LEV",
          "chapter": 15,
          "verse": 10
        }
      ],
      "en": "Whoever touches anything that was under him shall be unclean until the evening. He who carries those things shall wash his clothes, and bathe himself in water, and be unclean until the evening.",
      "ko": "그 몸 아래 닿았던 것에 접촉한 자는 다 저녁까지 부정하며 그런 것을 옮기는 자는 옷을 빨고 물로 몸을 씻을 것이며 저녁까지 부정하리라",
      "source_text_hash": "5a99586d27a360fcc6cd2962b8146e119c6157fb8af4922628a576d3fedc10ee",
      "translation_text_hash": "401da98869cc59c6d385b08060ae628112feae2326e610b25e5daf0d17d4153e",
