      "en": "“‘Whomever he who has the discharge touches, without having rinsed his hands in water, he shall wash his clothes, and bathe himself in water, and be unclean until the evening.",
      "ko": "유출병 있는 자가 물로 손을 씻지 아니하고 아무든지 만지면 그 자는 옷을 빨고 물로 몸을 씻을 것이며 저녁까지 부정하리라",
      "source_text_hash": "3ae2f08c7381b141af53496b42b69c5010a8573216ff9cc05ea084c8ade2009d",
      "translation_text_hash": "dd3ae2515b42f8bc7d51b250770de570ae8dad0153352e3922736e50ad270bbf",
