      "en": "Whoever touches these things shall be unclean, and shall wash his clothes and bathe himself in water, and be unclean until the evening.",
      "ko": "이런 것을 만지는 자는 무릇 부정한즉 옷을 빨고 물로 몸을 씻을 것이며 저녁까지 부정할 것이요",
      "source_text_hash": "f1bfa9cc6f8059cb5f657a074e6f2abd410144361c16b29c2926c897f57f6988",
